      <activity id="47fd8e26-6809-50c6-bae7-a09e7345e64e" activityNameId="baec46d7-7ba3-5ea4-af10-3bf438286942" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Slanted-roof construction, mounted, on roof, Stade de Suisse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Slanted-roof construction, mounted, on roof, Stade de Suisse
Production of the additional components necessary for the mounting of 1 m2 PV panel or laminate.;
UUID: 1baaffbe-9419-3fb5-9c1b-89bd363fa1e2
Materials and packaging for the production and estimation for metal processing. Disposal of the product after use. Energy use for the construction process must be included in data of the PV-plant.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Construction parts for a photovoltaic system.
Time period: Date of data investigation.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Aluminium and steel input from one large power plant installed in 2007 in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: From one product to the whole market. Correction factor applied to correct for today average weight per m2.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1baaffbe-9419-3fb5-9c1b-89bd363fa1e2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
